# the forms wiki/use.md shows that wap does not build yet: each red line is a to-do, fixed by building the form
use "check.wap"

check("versions compare part by part", version 1.9 < version 1.10.0, yes)
check("a missing part of a version is 0", version 1.2.0 == version 1.2, yes)
# a standard module's class works without its `use`, as its functions do
check("a standard module's class works without its use", Color(255).argb, 255)
